{"data": [{"author_id": "1154999117141032960", "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:06:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120639411713200371"], "id": "2120639411713200371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/ Where are we in the Fed liquidity cycle? Short version: paused, but likely close to restarting.\n\n2/ Bill purchases (RMPs) started Dec ‘25 at $40B/mo, tapered to $10B, then went to $0 from mid-Aug. 3 straight months of no new reserves.\n\n3/ The buffer is gone. Reverse repo usage", "url": "https://x.com/BetterCio/status/2120639411713200371"}, {"author_id": "26056832", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:06:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120548853086646371"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/afsheenjaf/sta…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/afsheenjaf/status/2120439243096858796", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/ZQPA4yhBoQ"}]}, "id": "2120548853086646371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The 2027 funding squeeze already has a published playbook. The Fed printed the tool and the size this month, and the market read past it to the rate-hike headline.\n\nThree balances set the board:\n• Reserve balances: $2,962.8bn (4 Nov, H.4.1)\n• Treasury General Account: $936.2bn https://t.co/ZQPA4yhBoQ", "url": "https://x.com/fredjacquemin/status/2120548853086646371"}, {"author_id": "1853828195235069952", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:41:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120300905601945871"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Pht89GIeQv", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Root_All_Evil/status/2120300905601945871/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120300724248555520", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/Pht89GIeQv"}]}, "id": "2120300905601945871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This chart is the money-market plumbing starting to show stress. The top panel is the SOFR–IORB spread (secured overnight funding rate minus the rate the Fed pays on bank reserves). The bottom panel is the Fed’s overnight reverse repo facility (RRP), which has collapsed from a https://t.co/Pht89GIeQv", "url": "https://x.com/Root_All_Evil/status/2120300905601945871"}, {"author_id": "500680205", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:49:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120589706933289417"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zVuRe6s6J3", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120589706933289417/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120589640986193920", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/zVuRe6s6J3"}, {"display_url": "x.com/MicNguyenn105/…", "end": 326, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120587755386491142", "start": 303, "url": "https://t.co/sq8WJQ5vil"}]}, "id": "2120589706933289417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 683, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "US bank reserves and the reverse repo facility have declined as a share of bank assets since the 2022 peak.\n\nThe chart shows the combined ratio rising toward 25% in 2021–22 before falling back to roughly 11% by late 2026.\n\nThis matters because reserves and RRP balances are part https://t.co/zVuRe6s6J3 https://t.co/sq8WJQ5vil", "url": "https://x.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120589706933289417"}, {"author_id": "500680205", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:44:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120497936031469994"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9IDvX2wRby", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120497936031469994/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120497868603879424", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/9IDvX2wRby"}, {"display_url": "x.com/MicNguyenn105/…", "end": 326, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120497668170600869", "start": 303, "url": "https://t.co/XdRPFg2lvn"}]}, "id": "2120497936031469994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 600, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "US bank reserves and the reverse repo facility have declined as a share of bank assets since the 2022 peak.\n\nThe chart shows the combined ratio rising toward 25% in 2021–22 before falling back to roughly 11% by late 2026.\n\nThis matters because reserves and RRP balances are part https://t.co/9IDvX2wRby https://t.co/XdRPFg2lvn", "url": "https://x.com/MicNguyenn105/status/2120497936031469994"}, {"author_id": "2025530895663546368", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:30:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120494280745930889"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VreAiW0kKG", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SovereignChainA/status/2120494280745930889/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120494275515592704", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/VreAiW0kKG"}]}, "id": "2120494280745930889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The Thin Red Line, Liquidity Abundance \n\nWhen liquidity is abundant, the system looks calm and orderly. That surface conceals architecture where modest velocity shocks can cascade quickly. As of mid-November 2026, Fed Governor Waller’s November 10 remarks and October CPI (+0.4% https://t.co/VreAiW0kKG", "url": "https://x.com/SovereignChainA/status/2120494280745930889"}, {"author_id": "1700357821538177024", "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120879292179464612"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bECkunw1wF", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/KushPatil_/status/2120879292179464612/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120842016741371904", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/bECkunw1wF"}]}, "id": "2120879292179464612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 364, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Markets felt shaky in October and nobody could point to the headline. The reason was a bank account.\n\nThe US Treasury keeps its cash at the Fed. When it collects taxes and sells bonds, that money leaves the banking system. When it spends, the money flows back.\n\nOn Oct 28 that https://t.co/bECkunw1wF", "url": "https://x.com/KushPatil_/status/2120879292179464612"}, {"author_id": "253138059", "created_at": "2026-11-12T02:03:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120698923845034065"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/luYum6jRWV", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Goeun_6121/status/2120698923845034065/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120698919784972288", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/luYum6jRWV"}]}, "id": "2120698923845034065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "FINANCE IDEA | November 12, 2026\n\nTHE FROZEN COUPON\n\nThe Treasury expects to borrow $618 billion from private investors this quarter, and about $800 billion in the first three months of 2027. Those are its own estimates, published November 2, built on a cash balance of $850 https://t.co/luYum6jRWV", "url": "https://x.com/Goeun_6121/status/2120698923845034065"}, {"author_id": "1127240462169989120", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:54:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120500442018832513"], "id": "2120500442018832513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Systemic USD liquidity is shifting. When the Fed’s Reverse Repo (RRP) drains while the TGA refills, institutional margin constraints tighten instantly.\n​If your desk is not monitoring the Net Systemic Liquidity equation, you are trading on lagging indicators. 🧵", "url": "https://x.com/KMenguete/status/2120500442018832513"}, {"author_id": "1533394307356532738", "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:55:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120952918060753152", "2120953678907506715"], "id": "2120953678907506715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 358, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "WASHINGTON'S DEBT MACHINE IS OUT OF CONTROL AND THE FED AND UST IS DOING NOTHING ABOUT IT. INSTEAD THEY ARE MAKING THINGS WORSE.\n\nAnother $325 billion in Treasury auctions today. That brings our cumulative debt refinancing and issuance tracker to $42.08 trillion since August 1,", "url": "https://x.com/SaroshQ2022/status/2120953678907506715"}, {"author_id": "1171493956795817985", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:10:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120866794625806634"], "id": "2120866794625806634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OVERNIGHT MONEY MARKETS — Nov 10\n\n▸ ON RRP (Reverse Repo): $152M | 3 counterparties | 3.75%\nTrend: down $100M vs prior (-39.7%)\n▸ Repo (Fed injection): $5M\n\n▸ SOFR: 3.89% | vol $3159B\n▸ EFFR: 3.88% | target 3.75-4.00% | vol $95B\n▸ OBFR: 3.88% | vol $211B", "url": "https://x.com/baalhadid/status/2120866794625806634"}, {"author_id": "1171493956795817985", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:30:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120509372321112222"], "id": "2120509372321112222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OVERNIGHT MONEY MARKETS — Nov 10\n\n▸ ON RRP (Reverse Repo): $152M | 3 counterparties | 3.75%\nTrend: down $100M vs prior (-39.7%)\n▸ Repo (Fed injection): $5M\n\n▸ SOFR: 3.88% | vol $3100B\n▸ EFFR: 3.88% | target 3.75-4.00% | vol $95B\n▸ OBFR: 3.88% | vol $211B", "url": "https://x.com/baalhadid/status/2120509372321112222"}, {"author_id": "2586808886", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:50:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120499483880616086"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZWk6H103wi", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/APM_Research/status/2120499483880616086/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120499411788922880", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/ZWk6H103wi"}]}, "id": "2120499483880616086", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A check on dollar funding pressure: SOFR was 2 basis points below IORB on Nov 9, 2026.\n\nThat is far from the positive spikes seen in late 2025. This spread tracks secured overnight funding against the interest rate paid on bank reserves. https://t.co/ZWk6H103wi", "url": "https://x.com/APM_Research/status/2120499483880616086"}, {"author_id": "432036004", "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:54:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120923270035743193"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/fflorescpa/sta…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/fflorescpa/status/2120921309194727562", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/8oXNu5dDDi"}]}, "id": "2120923270035743193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 438, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Treasury balances at the Fed are not included in M1 or M2. When taxes are paid, private bank deposits and bank reserves decline, while the TGA balance increases. So yes, money is destroyed in the sense of the monetary aggregates. The fact that the Fed records a corresponding https://t.co/8oXNu5dDDi", "url": "https://x.com/foscaecon/status/2120923270035743193"}, {"author_id": "1888516575478837248", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120303103115481493"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cYaxmzf0of", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/0xlunasterling/status/2120303103115481493/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120302290347413504", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/cYaxmzf0of"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/cYaxmzf0of", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/0xlunasterling/status/2120303103115481493/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120302290343182336", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/cYaxmzf0of"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/cYaxmzf0of", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/0xlunasterling/status/2120303103115481493/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120302290359963648", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/cYaxmzf0of"}]}, "id": "2120303103115481493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Goldman expects November bill buying and a December rate hike, and maps 2027 funding volatility\n\nZeroHedge, summarizing a Nov. 9 Goldman Sachs Global Rates note, said Goldman thinks the 2026 calm in U.S. monetary plumbing ends next year. A Goldman chart shows reserves plus https://t.co/cYaxmzf0of", "url": "https://x.com/0xlunasterling/status/2120303103115481493"}, {"author_id": "1192899214487019520", "created_at": "2026-11-11T03:55:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120364881329180876"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DuU6z8tevk", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/livefreeordie_t/status/2120364881329180876/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120364877084516352", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/DuU6z8tevk"}, {"display_url": "x.com/livefreeordie_…", "end": 328, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/livefreeordie_t/status/2118017874069696839", "start": 305, "url": "https://t.co/kGyVSlrYXY"}]}, "id": "2120364881329180876", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Treasury’s latest assumption is an $850B TGA balance at the end of December 2026 and the reverse repo (RPR) is basically empty.\n\nRRP is just cash that money market funds park at the Fed overnight instead of putting it to work, currently down about $5B.\n\nTGA is Treasury’s checking https://t.co/DuU6z8tevk https://t.co/kGyVSlrYXY", "url": "https://x.com/livefreeordie_t/status/2120364881329180876"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-11-12T20:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120969882493993159"], "id": "2120969882493993159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: November 12, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: A five-day USD 92.8 billion Treasury General Account drawdown to USD 922.80 billion lifted bank reserves to USD 2.963 trillion and relaxed SOFR to 3.88 percent. That", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2120969882493993159"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120607495588622565"], "id": "2120607495588622565", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: November 11, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: A USD 79.38 billion weekly TGA drawdown lifted bank reserves by USD 67.57 billion to USD 2.963 trillion alongside USD 573.36 billion in SOMA T-bills. This injection", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2120607495588622565"}, {"author_id": "3295423333", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:24:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120326705869156574"], "id": "2120326705869156574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25016, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC Conducts 187 Billion Yuan in Overnight Reverse Repo Operations at 1.25%", "url": "https://x.com/FirstSquawk/status/212032670586